{"timestamp": 1778713586.2723832, "duration_sec": 2.408834218978882, "validator_hotkey": "5C8LULGoFybR7ybg4S8qQkaaowGXFFja4KmMoSqwhxuAsn33", "task_type": "conversation_tagging", "task_raw": {"mode": "testnet", "api_version": 2.1, "guid": "HIDDEN", "bundle_guid": "HIDDEN", "type": "conversation_tagging", "scoring_mechanism": "ground_truth_tag_similarity_scoring", "input": {"guid": "HIDDEN", "input_type": "conversation", "data": {"window_idx": -1, "window": [[0, "Yeah, that, that's, man."], [1, "He would memorize the eye chart. So that when they covered his eye, he could sight it out like he could read it."], [0, "Oh yeah. Yeah."], [1, "How fucking crazy is that?"], [0, "He's got a hell of a personal story too. I was trying to encourage him to get that made. You know, like, honestly, man, I really look at these UFC fighters and, you know, the MMA guys as our modern-day heroes. They're our gladiators. And so whenever I have a chance, man, I always like to put them in movies and try to expose them to another kind of way of, you know, getting paid. Yeah. Especially afterwards, because it breaks my heart that they're heroes and then they get discarded sometimes. But not by the union that they're with, but just by the fans. They're so fickle sometimes."], [1, "Yes. Well, the casuals, the people that aren't really martial artists, right? Yeah."], [0, "So, you know, I just miss a."], [1, "Guy when they lose a few."], [0, "Yeah, I just did my third movie with Cowboy Cerrone, you know. We just finished a little over a week ago. Oh, that's\u2014 yeah, he's doing really good, man."], [1, "I love that."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["Comedy"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_temp